   385	Set `V=A2-B`.  The restriction `pi^{-1}(V)->V` is finite etale and is
   386	contained in `U`, so `t` is regular and integral there.  Since `O(V)` is
   387	normal, the coefficients of `P_t` lie in `O(V)`, and
   388	
   389	```text
   390	O(V)[t] isomorphic to O(V)[Z]/(P_t)                    (4.4)
