   557	they are `(2,1,1)`.  The hypersurface factor in (5.6) is regular because the
   558	defining equation has nonzero derivative with respect to `w`.
   559	
   560	For the node control, with `R=C[[u,v]]`, take
   561	
   562	```text
   563	S_n=R[z]/(z^2-u)  times R[w]/(w^2-v).                   (5.7)
   564	```
