   101	## 1. Frozen inputs and exact scope
   102	
   103	```text
   104	7d40e7ee6d5970c51d62f73bafaf11670cb32c06bd51859876ab526f0fdf8bab
   105	  xmodel/block-descent-a1-quartic-cycle1-pseudoplane-companion-threat-map-sol56-20260830.md
   106	2e6d82035df6717d1a39f31dc19b23b7c727bb940d4730d2c7ea9400e5433cce
   107	  xmodel/block-descent-a1-cubic-affine-survivor-funnel-sol56-20260830.md
   108	ed63b44c6a48f85c80b66e4b95b93618f1b3a4bead536a7ad7ee1bfa5084aac7
   109	  refs/chau1999_apm71_full.pdf
   110	```
   111	
   112	The charged producer supplies
   113	
